Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon cut off all axes in and out of\Ntown in order to find the Eighth Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was being held captive along with\Na lot of other people by the Bakemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To distract them,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I repeated the same chant that Joe had\Nused to make the Bakemon lose their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That worked until Phantomon got\Nwise and destroyed my recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Dark Tyranomon showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Palmon turned over a new leaf by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digivolving all the way\Nto the ultimate level,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lillymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, she was able to\Nreturn him to a tame state.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, just to make things\Neven worse, my Otismon arrived.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1\fad(300,0)}Break Through the Barrier! Zudomon Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kekkai toppa! Dododon Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.56,0:02:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you expect to beat\Nme with geraniums? Mm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nightmare Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lilimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, Sora, now! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about you, Mom? Just go! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor, win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's way too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away, you! You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come back just as\Nsoon as I find the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always getting beat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're getting good at this.\NNo way. Way? It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Creepazoid, he's cut off\Nthe whole entire district.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that crazy fog bank of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holding thousands of people prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so he can find the eighth child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's no telling what\Nhe'll do if he doesn't find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault, isn't it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all happening because\Nhe's looking for me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, that's why Mom and\NDad and everybody are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.11,0:04:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just the way things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring Mom and\NDad back home safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your little buddy got him on, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Matt, do me a favor and\Nlook after her till I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, I need you to be a big,\Nstrong girl for me while I'm away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't I always?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's 7.30.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't make it back by\Nthen, you guys get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Agumon! Okay. Be\Ncareful, man. See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, email from Gennai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:04:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salutations from cyberspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is no time for pleasantries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in a tight spot, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first thing to do is\Nput up a digital barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A digital what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're probably wondering what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, download the\Nprogram and I'll explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can put it up in time, the\Ndigital barrier will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.78,0:05:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Bakemon are getting\Ncloser every second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you go any faster, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told Dad I need a quicker modem.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.06,0:05:34.26,Sign,,95,0,35,,Water Bus Station
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all the commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh we're sorry but because of\Nfog conditions no ferries will be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.12,0:05:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,running to the district until\Nfurther notice what will we do in the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meantime please bear with us we're\Ndoing everything we can just have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to wait for the fog to lift i'm\Ngetting a bad feeling from this crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i think maybe we should\Nbe going tk hey what
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you suggest i do my\Nfamily's in there Mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, stay calm. You stay calm. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.08,0:06:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In cases of emergency, you might try\Nrenting a private boat down at the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I can suggest for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, whatever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is time to go, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, believe it or not,\Nwe'll be safer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those creatures will be\Nat our door any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me another\Ncouple of minutes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mom, let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.58,0:06:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, will you please leave that\Ncomputer alone and come on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear, maybe he knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's trust the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:06:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kids seem to know\Nmore about it than we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trickle treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital barrier coming on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital barrier is in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you know I can talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my name's Tentomon, pleased\Nto make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you going to do with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's going to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if I told you now, it would just\Nsimply ruin the surprise that's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, why doesn't\Neverybody take a little nut?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not him. Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not her. Okay, next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beware, Gatomon. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you lie to me, I will\Nsimply destroy them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we were going to be gators!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:08:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be in\Ntown with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I was across the harbor\Nwhen the power went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we're both stuck out here while\Neveryone else is in there. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows what Myotismon's planning\Nto do inside that evil blanket of fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we use to get\Nacross? This is what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.65,0:09:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Gomamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, fresh air!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, if you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK! TK! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Gomamon! Digivolve! Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:09:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.34,0:10:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's okay, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, this is a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name's Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very nice to meet you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was in TK's woodworking\Nclass at summer camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.14,0:10:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He nearly cut off one of my fingers,\Nbut that's a whole different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't go into it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.65,0:10:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The saw slipped, but I\Nmissed him by a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back with Matt\Nand Dad by dinnertime!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lost all of them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they might come back the safest thing you\Nguys can do is to stay right where you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are in here the digital barrier will\Nprotect you i'll be back as soon as i can
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so long wait you've grown so much izzy\Nand it's obvious you can take care
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of yourself but you will always be my\Nlittle boy so please son be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i will don't worry about me\Nmom i'll make sure he's safe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never a moment's rest.\NIt's always seize her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or grab him Or go terrorize that old lady
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm one poop spook Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stop talking Where are you keeping\Neveryone, you little creep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, so you're alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.37,0:12:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come back The convention\Ncenter My Otis mom's holding
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the prisoner there Everyone\Nin the whole district?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, including Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got your parents as well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've about had it with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sora, you go hook up with Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.24,0:12:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in the warehouse by Aqua City.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua City, Bertrand! Step on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plot thickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The satellite dish won't respond. Rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, there's got to be some way of\Ncommunicating with the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I had no idea TV\Nstations were so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to destroy\Nit, I should Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all we know, there might\Nstill be some people inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your Digimon's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine is Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon is like her best\Nfriend, but he's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got captured by the bad Goochiemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be awful losing your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mommy got captured by them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe my daddy got away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's all right, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And mommy will be, too, cause\NTy's gonna rescue her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.68,0:13:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure he will, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let's remember Ty's just one\Nkid and he's fighting hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want Mommy to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.58,0:13:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have some compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see she's\Nworried about her family?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're worried about yours, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we get past the bridge,\Nwe'll be through the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.52,0:14:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your tummy rumbling\Nor did I hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's up there by the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew this was too easy.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.70,0:14:25.21,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}MegaSeadramon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.70,0:14:25.21,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.70,0:14:25.21,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.70,0:14:25.21,Sign,,370,0,225,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Aquatic Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.70,0:14:25.21,Sign,,370,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.70,0:14:25.21,Sign,,370,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Thunder Javelin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's MegaSeadramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The regular old Seadramon was bad enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But compared to this fully Digimon\Nversion, it was just an angry guppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll probably get blamed for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heartful Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullseye, right on the button!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunder Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.! Joe! T.K.!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we're so good, Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that? Grab on! Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang on tight to that\Nand you'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want your\Nmom to worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for you. Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No monsters! Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No monsters digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.98,0:15:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cool that you're gonna Undead
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, who's that�� not-a-mons?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.19,0:16:15.91,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Zudomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.19,0:16:15.91,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.19,0:16:15.91,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.19,0:16:15.91,Sign,,370,0,225,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ocean Beast Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.19,0:16:15.91,Sign,,370,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.19,0:16:15.91,Sign,,370,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Hammer Spark
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he's one of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Zudomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the fully Digivolved\Nversion of Ikkakumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering when he'd finally show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's cutting an opening in the fog bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yippee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falcon's Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we better get going before\Nthe fog bank closes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Engines ahead full, Pseudomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, keep your eyes peeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:17:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if I were a fog barrier\Ngenerator, where would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back! Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that way either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got us surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty boring, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope we don't end up going\Nin the totally wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me to Tailmon,\Nplease! Huh? Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must find Gatomon. Important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you one of Myotismon's henchmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks beat up pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta give Gatomon this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's got somebody's crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it belongs to the Eighth Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Eighth Child!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother should have been back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:17:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.70,0:18:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Otismon's rounded\Nup the whole district.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's holding everybody\Nat the convention center.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never understood why the Master\Nis wasting all this time searching for
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Eighth Child when it would be so\Nmuch easier just to destroy you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Puskmon and watch out.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.21,0:18:37.76,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Tuskmon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.21,0:18:37.76,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.21,0:18:37.76,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.21,0:18:37.76,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Dinosaur Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.21,0:18:37.76,Sign,,370,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.21,0:18:37.76,Sign,,370,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Panzer Knuckle
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avoiding his razor-sharp\Nhorns is no easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here's the second\Nmember of our tag team.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.43,0:18:48.94,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Snimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.43,0:18:48.94,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.43,0:18:48.94,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.43,0:18:48.94,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Insect Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.43,0:18:48.94,Sign,,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.43,0:18:48.94,Sign,,370,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Shadow Sickle
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snimon. A deadly praying mantis Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is so appropriate because\Nyou're all about to become his prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digimon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.18,0:18:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we can take these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're going the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shuttle size! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.58,0:19:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garudamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twin Stickers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinda chokes you up, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.66,0:20:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the eighth child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'll just stop hurting my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come with you\Nquietly, wherever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a refreshingly helpful attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, man, stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Cory!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cory!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.40,0:20:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai is going to be so mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get all of you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.86,0:21:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give you a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the deep end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.52,0:21:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
